		(property "Description" "Heltec T114 V2.1 P3 order: 1 RESET_N, 2 PPS, 3 WAKE_UP, 4 GPS RXD, 5 GPS TXD, 6 backup 3.3V always on, 7 main 3.3V switched, 8 GND. RESET_N/WAKE_UP use L76K internal pullups; PPS unused. Electrical pin order verified; cable housing mating requires actual Heltec cable sample."
